OL,3,GNEWSACouple's Christmas display brings 
OL,4,Afestive cheer                          
OL,6,FFor more than 20 years, Martin and     
OL,7,FTracey Connolly have been spreading    
OL,8,FChristmas cheer by covering their      
OL,9,FGrimsby home in a colourful display of 
OL,10,Ffestive lights.                        
OL,12,F"It's something everyone looks forward 
OL,13,Fto," Martin said. "I like to think so  
OL,14,Fanyway. We always have a good turnout  
OL,15,Fand people always enjoy it."           
OL,17,FAbout a decade ago, the couple started 
OL,18,Fto collect donations for St Andrew's   
OL,19,FHospice in memory of a friend who was  
OL,20,Flooked after there.                    
